-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §156 שקט תעשייתי: in the agreement's term
-- neither party takes strike, lock-out or other organised action against
-- the other on what it settles; not on §154 or §155(ב)–(ד).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `156 שקט תעשייתי`

DECLARE `section 156 action` IS ONE OF `strike, lock out or otherwise disrupt work`

-- The clause names "סעיף 154154", a corpus sic (§154); it is read as §154.
@ref akn:art_156
GIVEN `a matter the agreement settles` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 156 action`
DECIDE `industrial peace` `a matter the agreement settles` IS
    IF `a matter the agreement settles`
    THEN (PARTY `the State` SHANT `strike, lock out or otherwise disrupt work`)
         RAND (PARTY `the teachers' union` SHANT `strike, lock out or otherwise disrupt work`)
    ELSE FULFILLED
